   }
  }
 ],
 "note": "r7.2 Atem session rules: the runtime reports a session's active rules; attachments with control get approval_rules on every change and after each sessions snapshot (none when there are none). Revoking one is a kind:\"approval_rule_revoke\" submission under the current lease: an inactive rule_id is stale_target and a wrong lease epoch stale_lease (nothing recorded, nothing dispatched); an active one is dispatched to the runtime, completes when the worker dropped it, and the empty list follows. Revoking it again is stale_target."
}
